hived [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]artifacts and cross-linking to its plan when it has one, with `sase[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]validate` proving the whole graph.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifact_persistence_sidecars.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]202608/prompts/artifact_persistence_sidecars.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-dh[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-dh/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust prompt-artifact contract and cross-repo header links[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add the Rust-owned staging manifest, pool naming, prompt link [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewriting, ARTIFACTS header section, and absolute PLAN/PROMPT targets, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus their pyo3 bindings.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Local .sase/artifacts staging at prompt launch[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]stage[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage: capture every prompt artifact reference into the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]content-addressed .sase/artifacts pool, move .sase/home under it, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record one manifest row per reference.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Agents sidecar prompt and artifact archive written by sase [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]commit[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]archive[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, stage[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]archive: write prompts/<YYYYMM>/ and artifacts/<YYYYMM>/ into the agents[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar at commit time, with inline artifact links, month indexes, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]locking, and outbox retry.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plan and prompt cross-repo linkage[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]crosslink[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, archive[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]crosslink: point plan PROMPT bullets at the agents sidecar, point [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]archived prompts back at their plans, and stop writing prompt snapshots [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into the plans sidecar.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Validation for the canonical prompt archive[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]validate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after crosslink[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]validate: add sase agent prompts validate, teach plan links validate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]about cross-repo prompt links, and wire the new check into sase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validate.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Migrate historical prompts out of the plans sidecar[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]migrate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after validate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]migrate: move every existing <YYYYMM>/prompts/*.md into the agents [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar, repair both link directions, and leave the plans sidecar with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]zero prompt files.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation, sidecar READMEs, and discoverability[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after migrate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: refresh sidecar README templates, user docs, and command help so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the new artifact and prompt layout is discoverable.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-dh","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-dh.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-f4c287128e928fb07e2a98cb8da68a4a","started_at":"2026-08-01T15:11:39.728634+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-dh","bbugyi200.athena.sase-dh.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-dh.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-dh.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-dh.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-dh.5","bbugyi200.athena.sase-dh.6","bbugyi200.athena.sase-dh.7","bbugyi200.athena.sase-dh.land"]}
